---
source: crates/daemon/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Read one item: the issue as reader text, or with --article the article it links to. --article contacts the article's site (named first) unless a copy is saved

Usage: mxr reading open [OPTIONS] <ITEM>

Arguments:
  <ITEM>

Options:
      --article
      --refresh            Fetch the article again even when a copy is saved
      --account <ACCOUNT>  Limit to one account; the default covers every account
      --format <FORMAT>    [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help               Print help
